# Trivy waivers for the backend image scans (ADR-0038): ci.yml job
# `image-scan` and .github/workflows/image-scan-prod.yml read this file.
#
# A waiver lets a CRITICAL with a fix through the gate while the bump that
# fixes it cannot ship yet. One vulnerability per line, a dated reason and a
# review-by date in the trailing comment:
#
#   CVE-2026-12345  # 2026-11-02: fix needs python 3.13 base; review by 2026-11-30
#
# Remove the line once the fix ships. An empty file means no waivers.
